<title>UK: EU sugar import levies.</title>
<headline>EU sugar import levies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>EU sugar representative prices and additional duties on imports effective April 29.</p>
<p>			 Representative price    Additional duty</p>
<p>			 (Ecus per 100 kg net)   (Ecus per 100 kg net)</p>
<p>			   New	 Prev	   New	  Prev</p>
<p> Raw cane sugar     24.85     24.85	  3.87-9.11  3.87-9.11</p>
<p> Raw beet sugar     24.85     24.85	  3.70-8.68  3.70-8.68</p>
<p> Coloured sugar     26.90     25.70	 11.78	12.42</p>
<p> White sugar	  26.90     25.70	  7.26	 7.86</p>
<p> Other syrups	  0.27	0.26	  0.38	 0.39</p>
</text>
